Greetings,

You can see both English and Turkish notes on the chart. Additionally, if you would like to access the Turkish 🇹🇷 version of this analysis, please check the second post. Since I started this analysis in English, I will continue accordingly.

What Has Happened Since the Previous Analysis: 
Following the $1.75 breakdown, the price tested the $1.58 support, where I took partial profit. However, the price resumed its climb without reaching my preferred support level $1.42 and my remaining position got stopped out above the blue box. This trade concluded with a minimal loss.

I told that, with a close above the blue box, I expected the price to head toward $2.15. Unfortunately, the price reversed at $2.12 this time and did not reach my take-profit level. However, I am still holding my position.

Current Thoughts: 
I consider the blue box as the current support zone and as long as it holds, I do not see a negative outlook for the price. I am looking to take a significant portion of my profit around $2.15.

If the market turns negative, I will not consider any new entries until $1.42 support zone that I mentioned in the previous analysis.

To avoid a repeat of what happened with my short position in the prior analysis, I am currently running a stop at entry. However, if I get stopped out, I will revisit the chart and attempt to re-enter on any potential bullish signals (confirmations) around $1.893. 
As I said, I do not have a bearish outlook unless the blue box is lost.

Wishing everyone a wonderful weekend ahead.</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="aspect-[25/17] overflow-hidden"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex h-full min-h-0 snap-x snap-mandatory gap-2 overflow-x-auto [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2045163195443065329/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" width="3286" height="1942" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfmnBWkAAoh07?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfmnBWkAAoh07?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfmnBWkAAoh07?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfmnBWkAAoh07?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/2045163195443065329/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2045163195443065329/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="750" height="1120" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfnbdXMAAkbOU?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfnbdXMAAkbOU?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfnbdXMAAkbOU?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGHfnbdXMAAkbOU?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: