sults",result:$R[169]={__ref:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI="},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMDMzNTE1MjU0MTIzMDE2MTky"},"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=":$R[170]={__id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=",__typename:"NoteTweet",text:"$RENDER\n\nGreetings,\n\nEspecially during these phases where the AI hype is making a comeback, I believe $TAO and $RENDER have been differentiating themselves from other altcoins and gaining solid momentum.\n\nIf you would like to review my latest #TAO analysis and the blue box highlight:\nhttps://t.co/TnRuwuU3nN\n\nAs for #RENDER:\nThe price has currently reached one of the active resistance zones. If $1.75 is lost, I expect the price to pull back into the accumulation zone. In such a scenario, the levels I would consider support are around $1.58 and $1.42.\n\nOn the other hand, if the price breaks through the immediate resistance, the next resistance zone I will be watching is around $2.15.\nAfter the price reaches that area and subsequently loses the blue box, I will once again bring the support zones mentioned above back into focus.\n\nWishing everyone a great week and successful trades 🤝\nBlessed Laylat al-Qadr to the entire Muslim community 🤲",entity_set:$R[171]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set":$R[172]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[173]={__refs:$R[174]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set:hashtags:0","client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set:hashtags:1"]},symbols:$R[175]={__refs:$R[176]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set:symbols:0","client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set:symbols:1","client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwMzM1MTUyNTQxMjMwMTYxOTI=:entity_set:symbols:2"]},smarttags:null,urls:$R[177]={__refs:$R[178]=["client:Tm9