rrent Thoughts: \nI consider the blue box as the current support zone and as long as it holds, I do not see a negative outlook for the price. I am looking to take a significant portion of my profit around $2.15.\n\nIf the market turns negative, I will not consider any new entries until $1.42 support zone that I mentioned in the previous analysis.\n\nTo avoid a repeat of what happened with my short position in the prior analysis, I am currently running a stop at entry. However, if I get stopped out, I will revisit the chart and attempt to re-enter on any potential bullish signals (confirmations) around $1.893. \nAs I said, I do not have a bearish outlook unless the blue box is lost.\n\nWishing everyone a wonderful weekend ahead.",entity_set:$R[223]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxNjMxOTUyNzk0Nzg3ODU=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxNjMxOTUyNzk0Nzg3ODU="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxNjMxOTUyNzk0Nzg3ODU=:entity_set":$R[224]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxNjMxOTUyNzk0Nzg3ODU=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[225]={__refs:$R[226]=[]},symbols:$R[227]={__refs:$R[228]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxNjMxOTUyNzk0Nzg3ODU=:entity_set:symbols:0"]},smarttags:$R[229]={__refs:$R[230]=[]},urls:$R[231]={__refs:$R[232]=[]},user_mentions:$R[233]={__refs:$R[234]=[]}},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxNjMxOTUyNzk0Nzg3ODU=:entity_set:symbols:0":$R[235]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNDUxNjMxOTUyNzk0Nzg3ODU=:entity_set:symbols:0",__typename:"ApiTagEntity",indices:$R[236]=[0,7],tag:$R[237]={__ref:"U21hcnRUYWc6UkVOREVS"},text:"RENDER"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA0NTE2MzE5NTQ0MzA2NTMyOQ==:grok_translated_post_with_availability":$R[238]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA0NTE2MzE5NTQ0MzA2NTMyOQ==:grok_translated_post_with_availability",__typename:"ApiGrokTranslateResponse",is_available:!1,data:null},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA0NTE2MzE5NTQ0MzA2NTMyOQ==:legacy":$R[239]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA0NTE2MzE5NTQ0MzA2NTMyOQ==:legacy",__typename:"LegacyTweet",possibly_sensitive:!1,retweeted_status_results:null},"